        "text": "Use y = 4 when x = 2.",
        "tex": "4 = \\frac{4}{2} + 8 + c \\implies c = -6"
      },
      {
        "text": "Substitute c.",
        "tex": "y = \\frac{x^2}{2} + 4x - 6"
      }
    ],
